                <section class="min-w-0 rounded-lg border border-slate-200 bg-white shadow-sm dark:border-white/10 dark:bg-[#111419]"><div class="border-b border-slate-200 px-4 py-4 dark:border-white/10 sm:px-5"><span class="pos-step">03</span><h2 class="inline text-sm font-semibold">Detalle de venta</h2><p class="mt-1 text-xs text-slate-500">Busca por código o nombre. El selector carga 10 resultados por página.</p></div><div class="min-w-0 p-4 sm:p-5"><div class="grid min-w-0 gap-3 sm:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_auto]"><label class="min-w-0"><span class="field-label">Producto o servicio</span><select id="productoSelect" class="w-full max-w-full"></select></label><button type="button" id="agregarProducto" class="admin-primary-button w-full self-end sm:w-auto">Agregar</button></div><div class="mt-5 max-w-full overflow-x-auto overscroll-x-contain"><table class="w-full min-w-[650px] border-collapse"><thead><tr class="border-b border-slate-200 text-left text-[11px] uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-500 dark:border-white/10"><th class="px-2 py-3">Producto</th><th class="px-2 py-3 w-24">Cantidad</th><th class="px-2 py-3 w-32">Precio</th><th class="px-2 py-3 text-right">Importe</th><th class="w-10"></th></tr></thead><tbody id="detalleBody"><tr id="emptyRow"><td colspan="5" class="py-10 text-center text-sm text-slate-400">Agrega el primer producto para iniciar la venta.</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></section>
